  "definition": "No generation or analysis acceptance cuts. Exactly one stable W+, b and bbar; primary pT(W+b+bbar). anti-kT R=0.5 E-scheme jets on stable quarks1..5/gluons. Radiation jets exclude stable b/bbar before clustering; all jets retain them. No jet pT or rapidity threshold. Absent jets have pT=0. All original signed events/weights retained, with no normalization to survivors or plotted range.",
  "missing": "Undefined rapidities are NaN coordinates, separately counted; never event vetoes. Log primary spectrum has separately accounted exact zeros and underflows.",
  "full_binary": "wbb_observables.bin starts with two native int32 values (nobs,nweights), then float64 rows [observables,weights] in input event order. wbb_weight_names.txt gives weight labels. This stream retains every event, including zero matching weight, while nominal remains nonzero."
